{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226520","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226520","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1222652001:1":{"text":"お願い、あたしの話を信じてぇ。あたしは絶対に嘘なんてつかないわ。","source_cn":"哎呀~不要怀疑人家啦！人家是绝对不会说谎的哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB16E83E3B44DF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222652002:1":{"text":"あの指名手配犯ちゃん、肌は青白いけど、けっこう可愛いわよねぇ。","source_cn":"那个通缉犯虽然有着惨白的皮肤，但长相还蛮可爱嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22FD8F588897AF69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222652003:1":{"text":"どこでそいつを見たんだ？","source_cn":"你是在哪里见到她的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x788411DCB41D72F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222652004:1":{"text":"あたし、毎日街の外に出て花を摘みに行くんだけどぉ。今朝、南門の外にある森の中で見たの。","source_cn":"人家每天都会出城采花，今天大清早，我在南门外的树林里看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x248BD2D0465C3CA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222652005:1":{"text":"あたし、賞金なんていらないからさぁ。ソニアさんにうちの花屋に遊びに来てほしいの。","source_cn":"人家不想要什么赏金，可不可以请索尼娅小姐来人家的花店坐坐呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE54FA3AA7A450A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222652006:1":{"text":"目先のお金よりも、あたしは話題性がほしいのよねぇ。","source_cn":"比起一时的利益，人家更想要能用来宣传的噱头嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7637BDD8C4371B91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222652007:1":{"text":"商売上手というか、なんともしたたかな女性ですね……ロワンさんと話が合いそうです。","source_cn":"真是热情的女孩子……而且很有商业头脑，罗万和她肯定会有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDE02D2FC602D8B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222652008:1":{"text":"本当に見たんだってば、他にどうやって証明すればいいのよぉ？","source_cn":"还要怎么确认嘛，人家真的亲眼看到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FA33FB192ABBD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1222652008":{"text":"本当に見たんだってば、他にどうやって証明すればいいのよぉ？","source_cn":"还要怎么确认嘛，人家真的亲眼看到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FA33FB192ABBD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222652009:1":{"text":"指名手配書にそう書いてあるじゃん……それに、あたしもこの目で見たしね！","source_cn":"通缉令上不都画着……况且，我也亲眼看到了啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1B690A8022AE3E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222652011:1":{"text":"あたしはよくあそこの森に行くの。鮮やかなお花がいっぱい咲いてるし、まさにラッキースポットって感じ？","source_cn":"人家经常去那片树林，那里的花格外鲜艳，看来那里是个幸运...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8317F8D6A8C36B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1222652011":{"text":"あたしはよくあそこの森に行くの。鮮やかなお花がいっぱい咲いてるし、まさにラッキースポットって感じ？","source_cn":"人家经常去那片树林，那里的花格外鲜艳，看来那里是个幸运场所呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8317F8D6A8C36B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222652012:1":{"text":"あ、あんたは花屋じゃないから、気にしてなかっただけでしょ！","source_cn":"这、这个，您不是卖花的人，不懂的啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC05FB5B9845DB129","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222652016:1":{"text":"あの時、彼女の後ろ姿を見たの。もう少し近づこうと思ったら、あっという間に消えちゃったのよぉ！","source_cn":"当时，我看见她的身影，正想走近一点，结果她立马就消失了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFE2CD2B72C306DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1222652016":{"text":"あの時、彼女の後ろ姿を見たの。もう少し近づこうと思ったら、あっという間に消えちゃったのよぉ！","source_cn":"当时，我看见她的身影，正想走近一点，结果她立马就消失了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFE2CD2B72C306DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat